   "allowedDiffPixels": 1289,
   "allowedDiffReason": "Kit slip: the standard docked toolbar's content slot hugs at a fixed 106px gap (items at 28 / 182 / 336), while the vibrant docked toolbar and the root's own SPACE_BETWEEN + 16px padding put them at 16 / 182 / 348 (Compose FlexibleBottomAppBar: Arrangement.SpaceBetween in 16px padding). We render space-between; the outer two icons sit 12px further out."
